<figure class="research-figure geometry-diagram">
  <div class="research-figure__header">
    <span class="figure-kicker">J-space geometry</span>
    <strong>From many directions to one sparse cone</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="geometry-flow">
    <section class="dictionary-panel">
      <header><span>1</span><strong>Many candidate directions</strong></header>
      <div class="token-field" aria-label="Illustrative overcomplete token dictionary">
        <i>animal</i><i class="is-selected">spider</i><i>silk</i><i>crawl</i>
        <i>insect</i><i class="is-selected">web</i><i>legs</i><i>small</i>
        <i>count</i><i>six</i><i class="is-selected">eight</i><i>answer</i>
      </div>
      <p><code>n_vocab &gt; d_model</code></p>
    </section>

    <div class="geometry-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><span>choose ≤ k</span>→</div>

    <section class="mixture-panel">
      <header><span>2</span><strong>Nonnegative sparse mixture</strong></header>
      <div class="coefficient-list">
        <div><span>spider</span><b style="--value: 82%"></b><code>0.82</code></div>
        <div><span>web</span><b style="--value: 54%"></b><code>0.54</code></div>
        <div><span>eight</span><b style="--value: 31%"></b><code>0.31</code></div>
      </div>
      <p><code>h_J = Σ a_i v_i</code> with <code>a_i ≥ 0</code></p>
    </section>

    <div class="geometry-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><span>one support set</span>→</div>

    <section class="cone-panel">
      <header><span>3</span><strong>One local cone</strong></header>
      <div class="cone-plot" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="cone-shape"></div>
        <i class="ray ray-a"></i>
        <i class="ray ray-b"></i>
        <i class="ray ray-c"></i>
        <b class="origin"></b>
        <b class="activation"></b>
      </div>
      <div class="cone-legend"><span><i></i>origin</span><span><b></b>J-space component</span></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="geometry-takeaway">
    <strong>J-space is the union of many such cones.</strong>
    <span>It is not one small linear plane, and the decomposition need not be unique.</span>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    The tokens and coefficients are illustrative. The paper usually limits a
    local reconstruction to about 25 active directions, but several directions
    can jointly express one broader concept.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

